--
-- The poster is 4:5 (1080 x 1350); posters here must be 1:1, 3:4 or 9:16, so
-- it is padded to 3:4 (1080 x 1440) by repeating its top and bottom rows.
--
-- Apply AFTER schema and seed. Safe to run again: it removes event 1052 first.
--   docker exec -i cpsu-etms-mysql mysql --default-character-set=utf8mb4 -uroot cpsu_etms < database/seed_genai_ethics.sql
-- =====================================================================

